12 Testing
**********

The package includes 160 tests: 122 for the core, 16 for the navigation
menu, 8 for the browser dashboard, and 14 for the subtree note
generator.  The second and third groups run with ‘make test-nav’ and
‘make test-html’.  The tests of the subtree note generator are in
‘test-autoslip-subtree-notes-generator.el’ and are loaded like the other
test files.

12.1 Running Tests
==================

12.1.1 From Command Line
------------------------

     # Run all tests
     make test

     # Run unit tests only
     make test-unit

     # Run integration tests
     make test-integration

     # Run with verbose output
     make test-verbose

12.1.2 From Within Emacs
------------------------

     M-x ert RET t RET

   Or load and run specific categories:

     (load-file "test-autoslip-roam.el")
     (ert-run-tests-interactively "^test-parse")

